in which ρ(l), ζ(l), and ϕ(l) are learnable or differentiable functions for respectively message constructions, message aggregation, and node update at the l-th layer.

Li expanded Eq. (12) by defining the message construction ρ(l) as follow: (8)\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
