\begin{document}
}{}\begin{eqnarray*}CI= \frac{1}{Z} \sum _{{\delta }_{i}\gt {\delta }_{j}}h({b}_{i}-{b}_{j})\end{eqnarray*}\end{document}CI=1Z∑δi>δjhbi−bj
where bi is the predicted value for the larger affinity δi, bj is the predicted value for the smaller affinity δi, Z is a normalization constant, h (x) is the step function presented as: (22)\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
