}{}\begin{eqnarray*}h(x)= \left\{ \begin{array}{@{}l@{}} \displaystyle 1 \mathrm{if} x\gt 0\\ \displaystyle 0.5 \mathrm{if} x=0\\ \displaystyle 0 \mathrm{if} x\lt 0 \end{array} \right. \end{eqnarray*}\end{document}hx=1ifx>00.5ifx=00ifx<0

